{"seq":1,"slug":"representment-evidence-package","title":"应诉举证证据包组装","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-chargeback-dispute-representment/dispute-representment/representment-evidence-package","wordCount":1670,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"应诉举证证据包组装\">应诉举证证据包组装</h1><p>应诉（representment）不是写一封辩解信，而是向发卡行提交一份<strong>结构化证据包</strong>：每条证据都挂在一个标准的证据类型标签下，每条标签在发卡行侧有固定的读取位置。发卡行的审核员每天要处理成千上万份答复，他们不会通读你的文档去找论点——他们会按标签查字段，看有没有能直接反驳持卡人主张的那一条。因此，证据包的质量取决于两件事：<strong>字段是否被正确填充</strong>，以及<strong>是否存在至少一条&quot;决定性证据&quot;</strong>（Compelling Evidence）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-证据包的两层结构\">核心概念：证据包的两层结构</h2><p>证据包由&quot;定性反驳&quot;与&quot;支持性数据&quot;两层构成。定性反驳是一条简短的文本，说明主张为何不成立；支持性数据是一组具名标签的字段与文件。Stripe 的 API 把后者显式建模成 <code>evidence</code> 对象，每个属性对应一个语义标签（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/api\">Stripe: Dispute evidence</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  E[证据包] --&gt; N[定性反驳 uncategorized_text]&#10;  E --&gt; S[支持性数据]&#10;  S --&gt; C1[客户身份类]&#10;  S --&gt; C2[交付/服务类]&#10;  S --&gt; C3[授权/认证类]&#10;  S --&gt; C4[政策/沟通类]&#10;  C1 --&gt; C1a[customer_name / customer_email_address / customer_purchase_ip]&#10;  C2 --&gt; C2a[shipping_* / service_date / access_activity_log]&#10;  C3 --&gt; C3a[3DS 结果 / ECI / AVS / CVC / customer_signature]&#10;  C4 --&gt; C4a[refund_policy / cancellation_policy / customer_communication]\">graph TD\n  E[证据包] --&gt; N[定性反驳 uncategorized_text]\n  E --&gt; S[支持性数据]\n  S --&gt; C1[客户身份类]\n  S --&gt; C2[交付/服务类]\n  S --&gt; C3[授权/认证类]\n  S --&gt; C4[政策/沟通类]\n  C1 --&gt; C1a[customer_name / customer_email_address / customer_purchase_ip]\n  C2 --&gt; C2a[shipping_* / service_date / access_activity_log]\n  C3 --&gt; C3a[3DS 结果 / ECI / AVS / CVC / customer_signature]\n  C4 --&gt; C4a[refund_policy / cancellation_policy / customer_communication]</pre><h3 id=\"具名标签为什么重要\">具名标签为什么重要</h3><p>以文件类证据为例：<code>shipping_documentation</code>、<code>customer_communication</code>、<code>refund_policy</code> 都是<strong>文件类型标签</strong>，每条标签只接受一个文件。Stripe 规定，同一标签下的多条材料必须合并成一个多页文件（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/best-practices\">Stripe: Dispute evidence best practices</a>）。工程上这意味着证据包组装器要做<strong>按标签聚合</strong>，而不是逐个文件上传。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ts\" data-code=\"type EvidenceLabel =&#10;  | &#39;customer_name&#39;&#10;  | &#39;customer_email_address&#39;&#10;  | &#39;customer_purchase_ip&#39;&#10;  | &#39;shipping_documentation&#39;&#10;  | &#39;shipping_tracking_number&#39;&#10;  | &#39;shipping_date&#39;&#10;  | &#39;service_date&#39;&#10;  | &#39;service_documentation&#39;&#10;  | &#39;access_activity_log&#39;&#10;  | &#39;refund_policy&#39;&#10;  | &#39;cancellation_policy&#39;&#10;  | &#39;customer_communication&#39;&#10;  | &#39;product_description&#39;&#10;  | &#39;uncategorized_text&#39;&#10;  | &#39;uncategorized_file&#39;;&#10;&#10;type EvidencePackage = {&#10;  disputeId: string;&#10;  network: &#39;visa&#39; | &#39;mastercard&#39; | &#39;amex&#39;;&#10;  reasonCode: string;&#10;  rebuttal: string; // 定性反驳&#10;  files: Partial&lt;Record&lt;EvidenceLabel, string[]&gt;&gt;; // 同标签多文件 → 合并&#10;  fields: Partial&lt;Record&lt;EvidenceLabel, string&gt;&gt;; // 文本类字段&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type EvidenceLabel =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | 'customer_name'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | 'customer_email_address'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | 'customer_purchase_ip'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | 'shipping_documentation'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | 'shipping_tracking_number'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | 'shipping_date'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | 'service_date'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | 'service_documentation'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | 'access_activity_log'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | 'refund_policy'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | 'cancellation_policy'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | 'customer_communication'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | 'product_description'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | 'uncategorized_text'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | 'uncategorized_file';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type EvidencePackage = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  disputeId: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  network: 'visa' | 'mastercard' | 'amex';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  reasonCode: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rebuttal: string; // 定性反驳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  files: Partial&#x3C;Record&#x3C;EvidenceLabel, string[]>>; // 同标签多文件 → 合并</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fields: Partial&#x3C;Record&#x3C;EvidenceLabel, string>>; // 文本类字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"文件规格约束\">文件规格约束</h3><p>证据包的物理规格同样是硬约束，超限会被拒收或不予审阅。Stripe 给出的上限是：仅接受 PDF/JPEG/PNG，总大小不超过 4.5 MB，总页数少于 50 页；Mastercard 的举证文件另有 19 页上限（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/responding\">Stripe: Responding to disputes</a>）。Adyen 侧还列了更细的分网络限制，如 PDF 单文件不超过 2 MB、Discover/Diners 不超过 3 MB、墨西哥境内不超过 800 KB，且禁止包含护照、税表、完整 PAN 等敏感材料（<a href=\"https://docs.adyen.com/risk-management/disputes-api/\">Adyen: Disputes API</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>典型上限</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>总大小</td>\n<td>4.5 MB</td>\n<td>超出被拒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总页数</td>\n<td>50 页（MC 举证 19 页）</td>\n<td>超出被拒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件类型</td>\n<td>PDF / JPEG / PNG</td>\n<td>其他格式被拒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>敏感数据</td>\n<td>禁止护照/税表/PAN</td>\n<td>上传被拒</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"按主张类型选证据\">按主张类型选证据</h2><h3 id=\"欺诈类-证明-是本人授权的\">欺诈类：证明&quot;是本人授权的&quot;</h3><p>欺诈类主张的核心是同一性问题：持卡人声称不是自己买的。反驳路径是证明授权存在。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>3DS/ECI</strong>：3DS 认证成功会返回 <code>authenticated</code> 结果与 ECI，通常触发责任转移（liability shift），但 Stripe 反复强调——<strong>认证成功不等于责任转移的保证</strong>，只能推断&quot;后来收到合格欺诈争议的已认证交易可期待责任转移&quot;，不能对任何单笔交易断言（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/payments/3d-secure/authentication-flow\">Stripe: 3D Secure disputes</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>AVS/CVC</strong>：卡验证码是印在卡上的 4 位数字，只有持有实体卡的人能提供，因此 CVC 校验通过是较强的本人证据；AVS 则比对账单地址与邮编（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/prevention/verification\">Stripe: Card verification checks</a>）。注意，合法客户也会 AVS 不匹配——搬家、输错地址都会导致。</li>\n<li><strong>地址/IP</strong>：与已核验账单地址一致的 IP，以及配送地址，都是支持性数据。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;disputeId&quot;: &quot;dp_1Kx2&quot;,&#10;  &quot;reasonCode&quot;: &quot;visa_10_4&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rebuttal&quot;: &quot;3DS 认证成功(ECI=05)，购买 IP 与美国账单地址所属州一致；同一设备在争议前 6 个月内有 3 笔无争议交易。&quot;,&#10;  &quot;fields&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;customer_purchase_ip&quot;: &quot;203.0.113.42&quot;,&#10;    &quot;customer_email_address&quot;: &quot;buyer@example.com&quot;,&#10;    &quot;product_description&quot;: &quot;Widget ABC, color: red, qty 1&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;files&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;customer_communication&quot;: [&quot;3ds-result-screenshot.pdf&quot;, &quot;prior-orders.pdf&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"disputeId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dp_1Kx2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reasonCode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"visa_10_4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rebuttal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3DS 认证成功(ECI=05)，购买 IP 与美国账单地址所属州一致；同一设备在争议前 6 个月内有 3 笔无争议交易。\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"fields\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"customer_purchase_ip\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"203.0.113.42\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"customer_email_address\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"buyer@example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"product_description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Widget ABC, color: red, qty 1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"files\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"customer_communication\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3ds-result-screenshot.pdf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prior-orders.pdf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"未收货类-证明-已交付\">未收货类：证明&quot;已交付&quot;</h3><p>未收货类主张的反驳是三件套：<strong>送货地址</strong>、<strong>发货日期</strong>、<strong>承运商与跟踪号</strong>。Stripe 特别说明，提交跟踪号时系统会展开成承运商的详细配送信息，但<strong>发卡行不会点开链接</strong>，因此关键页面要截图纳入证据包（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/best-practices\">Stripe: Dispute evidence best practices</a>）。</p>\n<p>项目交付的地址必须是 AVS 已核验的账单地址，或能与真实持卡人建立关联的地址；若配送到第三方名字（如礼物），需要额外说明差异原因。</p>\n<h3 id=\"服务-数字商品类-证明-已被使用\">服务/数字商品类：证明&quot;已被使用&quot;</h3><p>对数字商品与服务，没有物流可查，反驳转向<strong>使用痕迹</strong>：访问日志、登录记录、下载记录，且要带 IP 与时间戳（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/categories\">Stripe: Dispute categories</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE evidence_artifact (&#10;  id            BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  dispute_id    BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES dispute(dispute_id),&#10;  label         TEXT NOT NULL,        -- 见 EvidenceLabel 枚举&#10;  kind          TEXT NOT NULL,        -- text | file&#10;  value         TEXT,                 -- 文本值或文件引用&#10;  collected_at  TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  source        TEXT NOT NULL         -- order_svc | logistics | auth_svc | cs&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 组装时按 label 聚合，保证每标签一份文件&#10;SELECT label,&#10;       string_agg(value, E&#39;\\n&#39; ORDER BY collected_at) AS merged&#10;FROM evidence_artifact&#10;WHERE dispute_id = $1 AND kind = &#39;text&#39;&#10;GROUP BY label;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> evidence_artifact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dispute_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dispute(dispute_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  label         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 见 EvidenceLabel 枚举</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  kind          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- text | file</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                 </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 文本值或文件引用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  collected_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         -- order_svc | logistics | auth_svc | cs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 组装时按 label 聚合，保证每标签一份文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> label,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       string_agg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, E</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'\\n'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> collected_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> merged</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> evidence_artifact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dispute_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'text'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> label;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"证据强度与组装优先级\">证据强度与组装优先级</h2><p>证据并非等权。Stripe 的经验排序是：<strong>Visa 的 Compelling Evidence 是欺诈类翻盘的前提</strong>，没有它，Visa 欺诈拒付被推翻的可能性大幅降低；这套标准只有 Visa 强制，但 Stripe 建议对所有拒付沿用（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/disputes/best-practices\">Stripe: Dispute evidence best practices</a>）。</p>\n<p>CE3.0 的适用条件很具体：仅限 Visa 10.4；须找出<strong>同一持卡人、同一支付凭证、且在争议交易前 120 至 365 天之间</strong>发生过两笔无欺诈记录的交易；三笔交易之间至少有一个数据元素匹配——邮箱、配送地址、设备 ID/指纹、或 IP；此外还需三笔交易的商品描述，以及设备 ID/指纹/IP（<a href=\"https://support.stripe.com/questions/how-do-stripe-support-visa-compelling-evidence-3-0\">Stripe: Visa CE 3.0 支持</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>证据</th>\n<th>强度</th>\n<th>适用主张</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CE3.0 历史交易匹配</td>\n<td>极强</td>\n<td>Visa 10.4 欺诈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3DS 认证 + ECI</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>欺诈（附责任转移）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CVC 校验通过</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>欺诈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>签收签名 + AVS 匹配地址</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>欺诈 / 未收货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跟踪号 + 承运商截图</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>未收货</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>访问/下载日志</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>数字商品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>政策全文截图 + 同意勾选</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>续费 / 描述不符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅订单信息</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"组装流水线的顺序\">组装流水线的顺序</h3><p>一条高效的流水线按&quot;先自动、后人工&quot;排布：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>争议创建触发，按 <code>reasonCode</code> 选择证据模板；</li>\n<li>自动拉取订单、物流、认证、沟通记录四类数据源；</li>\n<li>命中 CE3.0 条件时自动检索历史交易并预填；</li>\n<li>按标签聚合文件、裁剪页面、压缩到 4.5 MB 以内；</li>\n<li>生成定性反驳文本草稿；</li>\n<li>进入人工复核，只在缺失决定性证据时才需要人工介入。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>第 6 步是控制成本的关键——覆盖率高的流水线里，只有少数争议需要人工。这条优先级判断与翻盘概率表联合使用，其经济学见 <a href=\"representment-case-win-rate\">representment 文案策略与胜诉率</a>；组装所需的数据源依赖支付时的信息采集，见 <a href=\"../friendly-fraud-prevention/3ds-avs-proof-delivery-control\">3DS/AVS/CVC/签收前置防控（联036）</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>证据包是&quot;具名标签 + 文件&quot;的结构化对象，不是散文；每条标签只接受一个文件，多条材料须合并。</li>\n<li>物理规格是硬约束：4.5 MB、50 页、PDF/JPEG/PNG，Mastercard 举证另有 19 页限制。</li>\n<li>欺诈类驳授权（3DS/ECI、CVC、AVS、地址/IP），未收货类驳交付（地址、日期、跟踪号+截图），数字类驳使用（带 IP 的访问日志）。</li>\n<li>3DS 认证成功不等于责任转移保证，只能推断&quot;可期待&quot;，措辞上不可断言。</li>\n<li>CE3.0 仅适用 Visa 10.4，需要 120–365 天前的两笔无欺诈同类交易且至少一个数据元素匹配。</li>\n<li>组装流水线先自动后人工，人工只在缺失决定性证据时介入。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"应诉举证证据包组装","id":"应诉举证证据包组装"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：证据包的两层结构","id":"核心概念-证据包的两层结构"},{"level":3,"text":"具名标签为什么重要","id":"具名标签为什么重要"},{"level":3,"text":"文件规格约束","id":"文件规格约束"},{"level":2,"text":"按主张类型选证据","id":"按主张类型选证据"},{"level":3,"text":"欺诈类：证明\"是本人授权的\"","id":"欺诈类-证明-是本人授权的"},{"level":3,"text":"未收货类：证明\"已交付\"","id":"未收货类-证明-已交付"},{"level":3,"text":"服务/数字商品类：证明\"已被使用\"","id":"服务-数字商品类-证明-已被使用"},{"level":2,"text":"证据强度与组装优先级","id":"证据强度与组装优先级"},{"level":3,"text":"组装流水线的顺序","id":"组装流水线的顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"发卡/收单/商户时效与金额规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-chargeback-dispute-representment/chargeback-mechanism/issuer-acquirer-timeline-rule"},"next":{"title":"representment 文案策略与胜诉率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-chargeback-dispute-representment/dispute-representment/representment-case-win-rate"}}